0B90           1389   ; These are the pins used for the keypad in this program:
0B90           1390   ROW1 EQU P1.2
0B90           1391   ROW2 EQU P1.4
0B90           1392   ROW3 EQU P1.6
0B90           1393   ROw4 EQU P2.0
